@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Sesión (Windows en SqlServer; demostración en Development/Demo)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/sesion

### OC de ejemplo; sustituir la referencia en modo SqlServer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/logistica/avios/ordenes/002/000001

### Requerimientos de origen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/logistica/avios/ordenes/002/000001/items/001/requerimientos

### Cálculo puro, sin escritura en SQL
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/logistica/avios/previsualizacion
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rows": [{ "factory": "001", "productionOrder": "NP-EJEMPLO", "style": "EST-1", "presentationCode": "1", "color": "Negro", "size": "S", "destination": "", "quantity": 21 }],
  "articles": [{ "itemCode": "AV-1", "description": "Etiqueta", "multiple": 5 }, { "itemCode": "AV-2", "description": "Sticker", "multiple": 5 }]
}
